ready: 1
kind: quality
id: sync.quality.no-silent-loss
display_id: QC-SYNC-NO-LOSS
module: sync
title: Sync never loses an edit silently
applies_to: [sync.seq.sync, sync.rule.conflict]
measure: Content edits made on any machine that are absent from every machine after both have synced, and deleted memories that reappear
target: None. Every edit is either applied everywhere, kept in version history, or held as a visible conflict, and no deleted memory comes back.
